OL,3,C'Extremely long waits' for patients as
OL,4,Chospital trust declares critical
OL,5,Cincident
OL,7,FThe hospital trust which runs the QEQM
OL,8,Fin Margate and the William Harvey in
OL,9,FAshford has declared a critical
OL,10,Fincident due to an IT issue.
OL,12,FEast Kent Hospitals University NHS
OL,13,FFoundation Trust has said patients
OL,14,Fattending emergency departments for
OL,15,Fnon-life-threatening conditions may
OL,16,Fexperience an "extremely long wait."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
