OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785341919
OL,3,C'Extremely long waits' for patients as
OL,4,Chospital trust declares critical
OL,5,Cincident
OL,7,FPeople are being advised to only
OL,8,Fattend the emergency department for a
OL,9,Flife-threatening illness or injury and
OL,10,Ffor those collecting family or
OL,11,Ffriends, to do so at the earliest
OL,12,Fopportunity.
OL,14,FThe hospital said planned procedures
OL,15,Fand appointments are being reviewed
OL,16,Fbut for patients to assume their
OL,17,Fprocedures are going ahead unless they
OL,18,Fare contacted directly.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785341919
OL,3,C'Extremely long waits' for patients as
OL,4,Chospital trust declares critical
OL,5,Cincident
OL,7,FSarah Hayes, Chief Nursing and
OL,8,FMidwifery Officer at East Kent
OL,9,FHospitals, said: "Our teams continue
OL,10,Fto work incredibly hard in
OL,11,Fexceptionally busy conditions to
OL,12,Fensure patients receive safe, high
OL,13,Fquality and compassionate care.
OL,15,F"The pressure on our urgent and
OL,16,Femergency services is extremely high,
OL,17,Fand we are focused on supporting
OL,18,Fpatients who need us most.
OL,26,@qD@ROU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1785341919
OL,3,C'Extremely long waits' for patients as
OL,4,Chospital trust declares critical
OL,5,Cincident
OL,7,F"Declaring a critical incident enables
OL,8,Fus to keep patients safe by drawing on
OL,9,Fadditional support from our colleagues
OL,10,Facross the health system.
OL,12,F"As always, we would like to thank our
OL,13,Fpatients and the public for their
OL,14,Fcontinued understanding. It's
OL,15,Fimportant that anyone who needs urgent
OL,16,Fmedical help continues to come forward
OL,17,F` using 999 in life-threatening
OL,18,Femergencies and 111 for other urgent
OL,19,Fcare.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
