OL,3,C'Extremely long waits' for patients as
OL,4,Chospital trust declares critical
OL,5,Cincident
OL,7,F"Anyone who is unsure about where to
OL,8,Fgo should call the NHS on 111, or
OL,9,Fvisit 111.nhs.uk for advice."
